# Naming

This file only decides names. Who may call whom is in `architecture-constitution.mdc`. JSON shape is in `api-type-safety.mdc`.

## Rules

- Use English words or a common abbreviation that says what the value is.
- Do not use Chinese pinyin or empty names (`tmp1`, `flag1`, `data`).
- Request and response fields are lowercase with underscores, and they match the JSON keys in the design.

```
✅ request_id, decided_by, expires_at
❌ requestId, approvalNo, shenpi
```

## Python

| Kind | Form | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Variable | lower_snake | `slack_message_ts` |
| Constant | UPPER_SNAKE | `SIGNATURE_MAX_SKEW_SECONDS` |
| Boolean | `is_` / `has_` / `can_` | `is_past_due` |
| Private | leading underscore | `_lock` |
| Function | lower_snake; private `_foo`; async `async_foo` | `prepare_create` |
| Class | PascalCase; exceptions end with `Error`; orchestrators end with `Orchestrator` | `CreateApprovalOrchestrator` |
| Module | lower_snake; tests are `test_{module}.py` | `orchestrator.py` |

Where a file lives is in `architecture-constitution.mdc`. Stale paths from search are in `path-map.mdc`.

## Domain words

| Meaning | Name |
|---|---|
| Idempotency key | `request_id` |
| Trace chain | `correlation_id` |
| One exchange | `exchange_id` |
| Calling system | `system_source` |
| Outbound URL | `callback_url` |
| Title / extra fields | `title` / `details` |
| Approval state | `status` |
| Operation outcome | `result` |
| Slack channel / message | `slack_channel_id` / `slack_message_ts` |
| Decider / decision time | `decided_by` / `decided_at` |
| Deadline / creation | `expires_at` / `created_at` |
| Callback delivery | `callback_state` / `callback_delivered_at` / `callback_error_log` |
| Card matches the row | `card_updated_at` |
| Timeout in minutes | `timeout_minutes` |
| Message exchange | `direction` / `source_system` / `target_system` / `operation` / `http_method` / `url` / `request_headers` / `request_body` / `response_headers` / `response_body` / `exchange_status` / `business_outcome` / `sent_at` / `received_at` / `duration_ms` |
| HTTP call log | `called_at` / `http_status` |
| Business audit | `from_status` / `to_status` / `actor` / `reason` |

`status` is only `posting`, `pending`, `approved`, `rejected`, `expired`, or `failed`. `result` is only `created` or `already_decided`. `callback_state` is only `pending`, `delivered`, or `exhausted`.

## Abbreviations

Allowed: `no` / `num`, `id`, `config`, `max` / `min`, `msg`, `ts`.  
Not allowed: `cnt` for `count`, `tbl` for `table`, `val` for `value`, `str` for `string`, `int` for `integer`.

| Incorrect | Correct |
|---|---|
| `requestId` | `request_id` |
| `GetApproval` | `get_approval` |
| `APPROVALREQUEST` | `ApprovalRequest` |
| `BaseRepo` | `BaseRepository` |
